<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Order History — Mastex Catalog</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
<script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

<%- include("partials/header", {mark:"MX", wordmark:true, title:"Order History", tagline:"Saved order lists", search:"", kbd:false}) %>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Order history</h1>
  <p>Every order list you've saved from the cart. Each one is a frozen snapshot — prices here stay as they were when you saved it, even if the sheet changes later. Edit quantities directly, or restore an order back into your current cart to reorder or build on it.</p>
</div>

<div class="banner">
  <div class="banner-inner">
    <span>🕘</span>
    <span>Shared across everyone using this tool, same as the cart and favorites — there's no per-user login yet.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" id="wrap"></div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script src="/js/cart.js"></script>
<script src="/js/favorites-badge.js"></script>
<script>
  window.__ORDERS__ = <%- JSON.stringify(orders) %>;
</script>
<script src="/js/orders.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
